COMMENT ON VIEW zapp.v_perf_dashboard IS 'Performance dashboard v1 — Agent 9 MONITORING-SETUP 2026-08-05. Consulta tempo real: queries lentas, status RLS InitPlan, uso de índices, conexões ativas.';


